OL,3,ABabydoll singer Jamie Miller covers    
OL,4,AChristmas classic                      
OL,6,FAfter spending four weeks at number one
OL,7,Fin the UK singles charts, Jamie Miller 
OL,8,Fis releasing his take on the festive   
OL,9,Fclassic It's Beginning To Look A Lot   
OL,10,FLike Christmas.                        
OL,12,FIn October, Miller became the first    
OL,13,Fartist from Wales to top the UK singles
OL,14,Fchart since 2011 with his TikTok-viral 
OL,15,Fsong Babydoll.                         
OL,17,FThe success transformed Miller's       
OL,18,Fcareer, but he revealed that his "made 
OL,19,Fit" moment was telling his taxi driver 
OL,20,Fdad and cleaner mum they could retire. 
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
